---

Note on the underlying legal text: the statutory text in `wa-rcw/`, the
administrative regulations in `wa-administrative-code/`, the court rules in
`wa-state-court-rules/`, and the local rules in `wa-county-superior-court-rules/`,
`wa-district-court-rules/`, and `wa-municipal-court-rules/` are government
edicts of a U.S. state and federal court. Under *Georgia v. Public.Resource.Org,
Inc.*, 590 U.S. 255 (2020), and longstanding precedent (*Banks v. Manchester*,
128 U.S. 244 (1888)), the official legal text produced by legislatures and
courts is uncopyrightable and in the public domain. The MIT license above
covers the scaffolding, organization, README/SKILL playbooks, and the markdown
extractions of that public-domain text contributed by this project.
